  "translation": "Today is Saturday. I got up at seven in the morning. I washed my face first, then ate breakfast. Today I ate a piece of bread and an egg, and also drank a cup of milk. Mom's breakfast was very delicious; she often makes breakfast. In the morning, I went to the bookstore with my friend. The bookstore is in front of the school, and there are many books inside. We walked from home because it's not far. My friend asked me: 'What book do you want to buy? A storybook or a dictionary?' I said: 'I'll buy a storybook.' That book is very nice. My friend didn't buy a storybook; he bought a dictionary. After returning home, I watched TV for two hours. In the afternoon, I went to the park to run. I was running when I saw my friend also there. We ran together. I ran for half an hour and was very tired. After returning home, I helped my mom cook. Mom can make many dishes. We ate rice and dishes. We were all very happy because we did a lot today. I happily went home."
